  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HELP US TACKLE WATER CRISIS 1 COMMUNITY AT A TIME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water is the most basic human necessity. Through the communities we serve, we have borne witness to the impact that water has on communities. Those that don&apos;t have access to clean water suffer on a daily basis. Using smart solar technology, our simple &amp; affordable solution provides safe &amp; clean water closer to homes &amp; schools. With a proven track record &amp; success rate, we want to scale up our efforts &amp; need your help in  building more water sources  &amp; provide water, hygiene (WASH) trainings.</narrative>
  </description>
